iseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO4ScanV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Scan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The initial accumulated value to start with."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"initialResult"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A closure that takes the current accumulated value and the next element from the upstream sequence,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and returns a new accumulated value asynchronously."}]}],"name":"nextPartialResult"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An asynchronous sequence that produces each intermediate accumulated result.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This operator works similarly to Combine’s "},{"code":"scan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" operator. It produces a sequence of values by repeatedly combining a running"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accumulated value with each new element from the upstream async sequence using the provided closure."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is useful for computing running totals, aggregating state, or applying stateful transformations over time.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example demonstrates accumulating a running sum over an asynchronous sequence of integers:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ An async sequence producing the numbers 1 through 5","let numbers = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    for i in 1...5 {","        continuation.yield(i)","    }","    continuation.finish()","}","","\/\/ Use scan to accumulate a running sum","let runningSum = numbers.scan(0) { partialSum, nextNumber in","    return partialSum + nextNumber","}","","\/\/ Consume the running sums","Task {","    for try await sum in runningSum {","        print(sum) \/\/ Prints: 1, 3, 6, 10, 15","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncSequences"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"symbol","title":"AsyncSequences","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncSequences"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","title":"Afluent","url":"\/documentation\/afluent","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/_Concurrency/AsyncSequence/replaceError(with:)":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"